{
  "id": 2055,
  "name": "diamond-pattern-cup",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "家での食事でも　活躍する　カップ。軽くて　丈夫で　重ねられるので収納や　持ち運びに　とても便利。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "집에서 식사할 때도 쓰기 좋은 컵. 가볍고 튼튼한 데다 겹쳐서 쌓을 수도 있어서 휴대하거나 수납하기에도 매우 편하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在家庭餐桌上也是常客的水杯。既輕巧又堅固，而且還能堆疊，因此在收納或攜帶上都很方便。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tasse pouvant être utilisée partout, même chez soi. Légère et solide, elle s’emboîte avec d’autres tasses similaires, ce qui la rend facile à emporter et à stocker.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Tasse eignet sich auch für den Gebrauch daheim. Sie ist leicht, robust und lässt sich stapeln, weshalb man sie prima verstauen und überallhin mitnehmen kann.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Apta para usarse incluso en casa, esta ligera y resistente taza se puede apilar con facilidad, lo que facilita tanto su almacenamiento como su transporte.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tazza leggera e resistente, ottima da usare anche a casa. Essendo impilabile è comodissima sia da riporre che da trasportare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cup that’s as good for using at home as on a picnic. It’s light, sturdy, and stacks well, so it’s a cinch to pack up and carry around.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "家での食事でも　活躍する　カップ。軽くて　丈夫で　重ねられるので収納や　持ち運びに　とても便利。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在家吃饭时也经常会用到的杯子。轻巧坚固，能叠起来收纳，方便携带。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
